  --- the reading ---
  THE TWO HALVES TAKE TURNS. `tau083` reaches anti-phase -0.754, beating BOTH of
  its own singles by at least 3 SE -- so it is the COMBINATION and not
  either ingredient, which is Matsuoka's prediction and the interaction this
  run pre-registered.
  A resonance moves both halves TOGETHER, so this cannot be the 3 Hz ring
  being re-measured -- the failure that killed adaptclock.
  BUT IT IS NOT A CLOCK. The exponent is +0.489 against ~1.000 required, so
  the period ignores tau_a -- competition WITHOUT timekeeping, in the same
  2.5-3.5 Hz band the pre-existing resonance occupies. Report the
  alternation and refuse the clock.
